## 1. Introduction & Overview

Welcome to **CleanMyPhone** ("we", "our", or "us"). We respect your privacy and are committed to protecting your personal information and device integrity.

CleanMyPhone is engineered as an **On-Device, Privacy-First Storage Management Utility**. All file indexing, duplicate photo detection, cache scanning, and storage analysis are performed strictly on your local physical Android device. **We do not upload, collect, store, sell, or share your personal files, photos, videos, contacts, or documents to remote servers or third-party entities.**

By installing and using CleanMyPhone, you acknowledge and agree to the data practices described in this Privacy Policy.

