## 5. Data Retention & Deletion Policy

- **Zero Cloud Storage:** Because CleanMyPhone does not operate external cloud databases or store your personal files on remote servers, no user files or media are retained on our servers.
- **User-Initiated Deletion:** All file cleaning operations (duplicate photos, temp files, large archives) are performed directly and permanently on the local device storage upon user approval.
- **How to Request Data Deletion:**
  - **Local App Data:** You can delete all local preferences, thumbnails, and cache at any time by navigating to *Android Settings > Apps > CleanMyPhone > Storage > Clear Data / Clear Storage*, or by uninstalling the application.
  - **Third-Party Data Deletion Inquiries:** If you wish to request the deletion of any anonymous diagnostic logs or advertising identifiers associated with your device, you may email us directly at **mobileplaystorework@gmail.com**. Requests will be addressed within 48 hours.

